    {
      "key": "cli.s0002",
      "start": 285,
      "end": 3713,
      "value": "zcode {expression0}\n\nUsage:\n  zcode [command] [options]\n\nWith no command, zcode opens the full-screen TUI.\n\nCommands:\n  app-server Run the ZCode Protocol stdio app server\n  commands   List custom slash commands ({protected0})\n  doctor     Inspect runtime and packaging assumptions\n  login [zai|bigmodel]  Sign in through browser authorization\n  logout     Remove the shared Z.AI login credentials\n  plugins    Manage plugins and marketplaces ({protected1}; alias: plugin)\n  skills     List local skills ({protected2})\n  tui        Open the terminal UI\n  version    Print the CLI version\n\nOptions:\n  -h, {protected3}       Show help\n  -v, {protected4}    Show version\n  -p, {protected5} <text>  Run a single prompt without opening the TUI\n  {protected6}   With {protected7}, enable automatic Memory extraction and wait before exiting (requires Memory enabled)\n  {protected8} <mode> Enable Browser Use backend (supported: headless)\n  {protected9} <surface>  Presentation surface for headless prompts/app-server: terminal or desktop\n  {protected10} <path> Chrome/Chromium executable for headless Browser Use\n  {protected11} <path>  Attach a local file to {protected12}; repeat for multiple files\n  {protected13} <path>     Run this command from the given directory\n  {protected14}, {protected15} <tools...>\n    Remove whole tools for this prompt/TUI run only; saved settings are unchanged.\n    Comma or space-separated tool names, e.g. \"Bash Edit\".\n    \"Bash(git *)\" removes all of Bash; command patterns are not matched.\n  {protected16}      Force mid-conversation system projection for Anthropic providers\n  {protected17} <locale>  UI locale: en-US, zh-CN, or auto\n  {protected18} <mode>    Permission mode for prompts: build, edit, plan, or yolo (default: yolo for {protected19})\n  {protected20} <sessionId>  Resume a persisted session by sessionId (sess_...)\n  {protected21} <text>  Run or set the session goal in headless mode\n  {protected22} Replace any existing session goal set by {protected23}\n  -c, {protected24}        Resume the latest session for the current directory\n  {protected25}           Print machine-readable JSON where supported\n  {protected26}     Print the OAuth URL without opening a browser\n  {protected27}       Disable ANSI colors\n  {protected28}        Print extra diagnostic detail\n\nSlash Commands:\n  {protected29} [command]       Show slash command help\n  {protected30}                Choose Z.AI or BigModel browser login\n  {protected31}               Remove the shared Z.AI login credentials\n  {protected32} [instructions]  Compact the current conversation\n  {protected33} [status|resume|stop|<task>]  Run or manage the expert workflow\n  {protected34} [list|cancel|resume]  List, cancel, or resume dynamic workflow runs\n  {protected35} [latest|checkpointId]  Fork a new session from a workspace checkpoint\n  {protected36} [list|status|connect|disconnect]  Show or manage MCP servers\n  {protected37} [mode]          Show or switch permission mode: build, edit, plan, or yolo\n  {protected38} [id]           Show or switch the current session model\n  {protected39}                  Start a fresh session in the TUI\n  {protected40} [sessionId]   Resume a session by sessionId; omit it for latest in cwd\n  {protected41} [latest|checkpointId]  Show latest checkpoint or restore workspace files\n  {protected42} [name] [task]  List skills, or force the next prompt to load one\n  {protected43} [action]        Show or set the current session goal\n",
